sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User/Channel
  participant G as Gateway
  participant A as Agent loop
  participant W as skill-workshop
  participant S as proposals store
  participant WS as workspace/skills
  U->>G: Fix deploy script (Telegram/WhatsApp)
  G->>A: skills snapshot (metadata XML)
  A->>A: read tool → full SKILL.md
  A->>U: success reply
  Note over W: agent_end hook
  W->>W: createProposalFromMessages (regex)
  W->>W: reviewTranscriptForProposal (LLM)
  W->>S: save pending proposal
  W->>W: scanSkillContent()
  alt approvalPolicy auto
    W->>WS: applyProposalToWorkspace
  else manual
    Note over U: user approves in UI
    U->>W: approve
    W->>WS: apply
  end